### ============================================================
### 52-JMH Performance Microbenchmark API Testing (Port: 8152)
### ============================================================

### 1. Xem danh sách các bài Benchmark JMH có sẵn
GET http://localhost:8152/api/benchmarks/info
Accept: application/json

### 2. Kích hoạt chạy thử nghiệm Benchmark nhanh (1 iteration - StringBenchmark)
POST http://localhost:8152/api/benchmarks/run-quick
Accept: application/json
